t : 632 - End : 1083\n\n![Price/Sq.ft](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/price-tag.png)\n\nPrice/Sq.ft  \n  24007.39\n\n![All in price](https://jannathomes.com/assets/icons/note.png)\n\nAll in one price  \n  1.20 Cr - 2.60 Cr\n\nLand Size\n\n2.5 ACRES\n\nNo of Towers\n\n1\n\nNo of Storeys\n\n48\n\nPossession Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\nPossession Date\n\nDec, 2024\n\nProject Rera No\n\nP51800029939\n\nAdvertiser Rera No\n\nA51800011711\n\n##### Introduction to Gauri Excellency\n\n**Most Luxurious & Spacious Project**\n\nGauri Excellency Project will be constructed on 2.5 acres of land parcel, 1 tower with G+5P+48 floors having 1 BHK, 2 BHK premium residences.  \n At Gauri Excellency you will discover more and more. The white clouds that floats from your balcony , turns into the blue sky giving the largest open space of your window the feel of cinemascopic screens.\n\nThe Architecture of Gauri Excellency combines aesthetic design with meticulous planning , sprawling spaciousness with optimum use of built - up space. Here a sense of quiet and spaciousness has been created with a grand entrance lobby, so you never feel cramped or crowded.\n\nGauri Excellency designed by world renowned architect Hafeez Contractor is Set to be one of the keys to happiness with most vibrant communities to reside.\n\n[#### Amenities](javascript:void(0);)\n\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/08/25/6307669c6758d7-59336891.jpg)balcony\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/02/6311be078ba2d9-85820372.jpg)Car Parking\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05077e9b612-72077823.jpg)Garden\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f05040b0b828-36177329.jpg)Gymnasium\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315a71270bdd6-61887784.jpg)Jogging track\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2021/07/15/60f0523d3ca665-43164855.jpg)Kids Play Area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/01/631076c5888133-27323167.jpg)Regular Water Supply\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/09/05/6315aafc3a2db1-08158002.jpg)Senior citizen area\n* ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/amenities/icon/2022/08/25/63076704121bd4-42236428.jpg)yoga deck\n\n[#### Pricing, Floor Plans & Room Sizing](javascript:void(0);)\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Type | Carpet Area | Price () | Floor Plans | Room Sizes | PDF |\n[1 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 1 BHK | 632.00 Sq.ft | 1.20 Cr | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) |\n\nNA\n\n\n[2 BHK](javascript:void(0))| 2 BHK | 1083.00 Sq.ft | 2.60 Cr | [View](javascript:void(0)) | [View](javascript:void(0)) |\n\nNA\n\n[#### Bank Offers](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/bank/image/2022/09/03/6312ea3c0fdc45-18460629.jpg) ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/bank/image/2022/08/05/62ecf753d03c61-52107828.jpg) ![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/bank/image/2022/09/03/6312e831b98570-23434271.jpg)\n\n[#### Location](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[#### Gauri land developers](javascript:void(0);)\n\n![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/developer/logo/2022/12/03/638afd170d9830-01912989.jpg)\n\n* Established In1991\n* Total Projects13\n\nThe Goal of Gauri Group, is to provide an outstanding level of service and expertise in the real estate market that is innovative and ambitious. The group is dedicated to the highest standards, systems and performance necessary to fulfil all of your real estate dreams.\n\n[#### More Projects by Gauri land developers](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[![](https://jannathomes.com/uploads/gallery/2024/07/26//img_x_50066a3b14f5613a5-98642958.jpg)](https://jannathomes.com/project/mumbai-million/504)\n\n#### [Mumbai Million](https://jannathomes.com/project/mumbai-million/504)\n\nBy Gauri land developers\n\n1,2 BHK\n\n80.00 L - 1.42 Cr\n\nMalad West\n\n[#### Brochure](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[![