emises/sale/all-locations)[Builders & Developers](/builders)[Why Us](/why-us)[RERA Search](/rera-search)[Localities](/locations)[Tools & Calculators](/tools/budget-planner)[NRI Hub](/nri-hub)[News](/news)[+ List Your Property](/list-property)[💬 WhatsApp Us](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\nMumbai property advisory & dataOperating since 1995✓ MahaRERA A51800043517Source-labelled project dataWe reply in minutes on WhatsApp\n\n![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-main.webp)✓ MahaRERA P51800004832RERA: no litigation reported\n\n# Gauri Excellency\n\nby Gauri Land Developers\n\n📍 Kandivali West, Mumbai Suburban · 400067\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Completed/historical project — current inventory unconfirmed**\n\nAsk an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.\n\nSource stage: Sold Out · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\nPooja Batra · Senior Advisor\n\nMumbai Property Exchange · MahaRERA-registered since 2017\n\n[📞 Call](tel:+919819311244)[💬 WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=Hi%20MPE%2C%20I%20have%20a%20property%20query)\n\n★\n\n## Gallery\n\n![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-floor-.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-floor-plan.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-location-plan.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-bedroom.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-indoor-games.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-master-.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth--1-.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth--2-.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth--3-.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-28-dec-2015.webp)![Gauri Excellency](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/10011/10011-oth-26-april-2018.webp)\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nGauri Excellency is a Project by Gauri Group of Companies. It is located at Kandivali West. Well connected to Railway station. Close proximity to all the daily convenience. It offers 1 and 2 BHK Residences with private decks. RCC frame structure, commercial and retails shops within the vicinity. Ground + 48 Storeyed tower (5 level podium + 6th as Amenities floor + 42 residential floors) spread across 2 Wings (Wing A & Wing B). 6 flats per floor (i.e. - Two 1bhks & Four 2bhks). Has more than 20 amenities. Exclusive Lifestyle Amenities – Steam Room/Sauna/Jacuzzi, Reflexo Path, Star Gazing, Dancing Fountains, Open Library, Cafeteria, Game Station, Kids Sandpit, Kids Creche Area, Children’s Play Area, Landscape Garden, Senior Citizen Zone, Gymnasuim, Yoga Room, Jogging Track, Community Hall, Wi-Fi Zone, Multi Level Car Park, 24x7 CCTV Security, Indoor games, Double heighted entrance lobby, Driver’s Lounge. RERA approved project.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹29,095\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹37,500**\n\n22% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹29,095/sqft** — **15% above** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2020\n\nRevised\n\nDec 2020\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n1 BHK457 ft²₹1.33 Cr\n\n2 BHK732–764 ft²₹2.13 Cr–₹2.22 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Gauri%20Excellency%20(RERA%20P51800004832))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800004832\n\nRegistered\n\n2026-02-09\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nKOTAK MAHINDRA BANK LIMITED\n\nArchitect\n\nSameer Kulkarni\n\nTotal FSI\n\n19344\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nGauri Excellency Wing A And B37 floors · 315 units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Kandivali West  \n19.204996999999999,72.824374000000006\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nM/S GAURI LAND DEVELOPERS LLPNA\n\nSAMEER KULKARNIArchitect\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAvail\n\n1 BHK457 ft²₹1.35 Cr—\n\n2 BHK733 ft²₹2.1 Cr—\n\n09\n\n## Construction Progress\n\n83% avg\n\nBasement (if any)100%\n\nExcavation100%\n\nExternal plumbing and external plaster, elevation, completion of terraces with waterproofing of the Building / wing.100%\n\nInternal walls, Intemal Plaster, Floorings, Floors and windows within Flats/Premises100%\n\nPlinth100%\n\nPodiums (if any) 100%\n\nInstallation of Lifts, water pumps, Fire Fighting Fittings and Equipment as per CFO NOC, Electrical fittings, mechanical equipment, compliance to conditions ofenvironment/CRZ NOC, Finishing to entrance lobby/s, plinth protection. paving of areas appurtenant to Building/Wing, Compound Wall and all other requirements as may be required to complete project as per specifications in agreement of Sale.95%\n\nStaircases, Lifts Wells and Lobbies at each Floor level Overhead and Underground Water Tanks95%\n\nSanitary Fittings within the flats / premises90%\n\nSlabs of Super Structure31%\n\nStilt Floor 0%\n\n10\n\n## Amenities\n\nAggregate area of recreational Open SpaceElectrical Meter Room, Sub-Station, Receiving StationEnergy managemcntEnergy managementFire Protection And Fire Safety RequirementsInternal Roads & FootpathsLandscaping & Tree PlantingLandscaping & Tree PlantingSewerage (Chamber, Lines, Septic Tank , STP)Solid Waste Management And DisposalStorm Water DrainsStreet LightingTreatment And Disposal Of Sewage And Sullage WaterWater Conservation, Rain water HarvestingWater SupplyWater conservation /Rain water harvesting\n\n11\n\n## Connectivity\n\nRailway\n\n15-20 min\n\nAirport\n\n30-40 min\n\nHospital\n\n15-min\n\nSchool\n\n15-20 min\n\n12\n\n## Talk to our MahaRERA advisor\n\n🏠 Discuss what you're looking for📍 Locality & project guidance🤝 Speak to a specialist\n\nTell our MahaRERA advisor what you need and they'll guide you on this project.\n\n[💬 Ask about resale or rental options](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Gauri%20Excellency%20(RERA%20P51800004832))\n\n08\n\n## Property Rates in Kandivali West\n\nResidential · Sale\n\n₹20,000–55,000/sqft\n\nCommercial · Sale\n\n₹20,000–35,000/sqft\n\n2 BHK · Rent\n\n₹45,000–95,000/mo\n\nFull rates\n\n[Property Rates ▸](/property-rates)\n\n09\n\n## Resale Flats for Sale in Kandivali West\n\n4\n\n[![Siddha Seabrook](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/properties/propImages/9705873/18_thumb.webp)₹2.32 Cr\n\n2 BHK · 706 sqft\n\nSiddha Seabrook\n\n📍 Kandivali West](/property/9915464/2-siddha-seabrook-kandivali-west)[![Siddha Seabrook](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/properties/propImages/9705873/18_thumb.webp)₹3.45 Cr\n\n3 BHK · 975 sqft\n\nSiddha Seabrook\n\n📍 Kandivali West](/property/9960521/3-siddha-seabrook-kandivali-west)[![Veena Smart Homes](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/28807/28807-main_thumb.webp)₹1.05 Cr\n\n1