sold to happy owners. These homeowners have been supported by some of India’s most reliable banks and housing finance companies (HFCs), providing a seamless and secure home loan experience.\n\n## About Gauri Excellency\n\nGauri Excellency is a residential project located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Gauri Group, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers highly affordable apartments with different configurations, including 1 & 2 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 15,700. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 1 BHK is 516 sqft. The... Read More\n\nGauri Excellency is a residential project located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, developed by the Gauri Group, one of the leading real estate developers in India.\n\nThe project offers highly affordable apartments with different configurations, including 1 & 2 BHK. The average price per square feet of the apartments is Rs 15,700. The apartments are designed to provide a comfortable living experience, with spacious rooms, high-quality finishes, and modern amenities. The area of 1 BHK is 516 sqft. The area of 2 BHK are in the range of 840 - 879 sqft. A 1 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 81.2 lakhs. A 2 BHK Apartment is available at a starting price of Rs 1.3 Crs.\n\nGauri Excellency also offers a range of world-class amenities, including Children's Play area, Gymnasium, Jogging Track, Swimming Pool and Indoor Games.\n\nThe prime location of Gauri Excellency is a significant advantage for prospective homebuyers, as it is positioned in one of Mumbai's most desirable neighbourhoods. Kandivali West, an already well-developed area, provides excellent connectivity to the rest of the city. The project enjoys close proximity to major roads, railway stations, metro stations, and bus stations, resulting in reduced commuting time for office-goers. Additionally, the neighbourhood offers abundant options for retail shopping and fulfilling daily needs.\n\nOverall, Gauri Excellency is an exceptional residential project that ensures a comfortable living experience for its residents through its top-notch amenities and outstanding location.\n\n---\n\n##### Amenities\n\n![Children's Play area](/images/revamp_amenities/childrens_play_area.png \"Children's Play area\")\n\nChildren's Play area\n\n![Gymnasium](/images/revamp_amenities/gymnasium.png \"Gymnasium\")\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Jogging Track](/images/revamp_amenities/jogging_track.png \"Jogging Track\")\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Swimming Pool](/images/revamp_amenities/swimming_pool.png \"Swimming Pool\")\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Indoor Games](/images/revamp_amenities/indoor_games.png \"Indoor Games\")\n\nIndoor Games\n\n---\n\n##### More info about Gauri Excellency\n\n* About Locality\n* Investments\n\nKandivali in Mumbai is a well-developed locality with a variety of amenities available within a reasonable distance. Connectivity is extremely effortless thanks to the Western Express Highway, S.V. Road and the Kandivali Railway Station.\n\nThere are numerous healthcare facilities, educational institutions and shopping complexes that are in the vicinity to ensure a comfortable living:\n\n**Healthcare Facilities:**\n\n* Zenith Hospital\n* Mangal Murti Hospital\n\n**Educational Institutions:**\n\n* Atharva College of Engineering\n* Ryan International School\n* Billabong International School\n* Don Bosco High School\n\n**Shopping Complexes:**\n\n* Infinity Mall\n* Oberoi Mall\n* Inorbit Mall\n\n**Sports Club**\n\n* Sachin Tendulkar Club\n* Goregaon Sports Club\n\nKandivali is a rapidly developing area in Mumbai that has observed a surge in real estate investments in recent years. It is well-connected to the rest of the city and other suburbs and offers a range of residential and commercial properties at relatively affordable prices. Additionally, the area has seen significant infrastructural development, with improved road connectivity, upcoming metro projects, and other amenities being added. Thanks to the Western Express Highway, the connectivity to prominent business districts such as Vikhroli, Goregaon and BKC is seamless. This is one of the many reasons why Kandivali is a popular residential market. This is why the future of real estate investments is looking bright in Kandivali.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/635a4aa6831fdd6844dbdb70/e66c2a75-6be9-4320-bfeb-e186e281dac5_elevationgauri.png)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* Similar Properties\n* Nearby Properties\n* More properties by Gauri Group\n\n[![Sandhya Charkop Jeevan Mangal-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/646def1ada245958afa7cedf/c4c7f3c9-bbb9-4f3b-95c1-9b6a2a3bd908_elevationmangal.png)\n\n#### Sandhya Charkop Jeevan Mangal\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1 & 2 BHK Flats\n\n73 L-1.0 Cr](/properties/details/sandhya-kshitij-builders/kandivali-west/sandhya-charkop-jeevan-mangal/646def1ada245958afa7cedf)\n\n[![Vora Skyline Centrico-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/646c8360da245958afa7ce9f/7cac69b4-3bd2-4c94-b3ee-ae0577ccb062_Screenshot2023-05-24174548.png)\n\n#### Vora Skyline Centrico\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2 & 4 BHK Flats\n\n1.5 Cr-2.6 Cr](/properties/details/vora-skyline/malad-west/vora-skyline-centrico/646c8360da245958afa7ce9f)\n\n[![Anant Tara-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/643cf42923fd8d19d1de8636/73a3d6c0-1b65-42fd-9108-6182b5753d9b_elevationananttara.png)\n\n#### Anant Tara\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1 & 2 BHK Flats\n\n74 L-1.2 Cr](/properties/details/anant-group/kandivali-west/anant-tara/643cf42923fd8d19d1de8636)\n\n[![Gauri Excellency Nx-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/641aa3a2fd1c3b34ad7284d4/a2b5c871-569d-4a66-befa-eaca0867b48d_Screenshot_20230522_154102.png)\n\n#### Gaur